[gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3]

; The one variable: a `default_font` whose OS/2 sets USE_TYPO_METRICS with typographic metrics that
; differ from its `hhea`, so FreeType takes the typographic ones and the labels sit higher than the
; `hhea` would put them. The `.otf` and `.woff2` sibling scenes use fonts whose two sets agree, so
; none shows a regression in it. Godot arbitrates the vertical position directly.

